  "contentHtml": "<p>1학기</p><p>교내 동료장학을 마치고</p><p>전체 교사 대상</p><p>수업 나눔 콘서트를 운영하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>2023.7.6.</p><p>경기도수석교사 직무연수에서</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">수업 토크 행사의</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">준비-운영-제언을 소개한</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">동영상입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/S8frT9Xe1ds\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/S8frT9Xe1ds</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S8frT9Xe1ds\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/1GVtF/hyTgUlfS8T/loYfrHyZN1jyt8HXfQv9Kk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S8frT9Xe1ds\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
